header(class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center px-2")

  div(class="container-alert")

  div(class="text-center text-white pb-5")
    div(class="fs-1 fw-bold pb-2") Encurte seus links.
    div Links são longos. Encurte os links que você deseja compartilhar, e acompanhe enquanto viajam através da internet.

  form(
    action="/"
    method="post"
    class="w-100 flex-nowrap d-flex justify-content-center gap-3"
  )
    div(class="col-md-5")
      div(class="input-group")
        input(
          name="url"
          id="url"
          type="url"
          value=url
          required
          placeholder="Cole o seu link aqui"
          aria-label="Cole o seu link aqui"
          aria-describedby="Botão de limpar campo"
          class="form-control border-0 border-bottom rounded-0 border-warning"
        )
        button(
          class="btn btn-clear rounded-pill"
          type="button"
          id="clear"
        )
          i(class="bi bi-x text-white")

    button(
      class="button btn btn-warning text-light fw-semibold col-md-2"
      id='actionBtn'
      type='button'
      data-action=encurtar ? 'copiar' : 'encurtar'
    )
      = encurtar ? 'COPIAR' : 'ENCURTAR'

